      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MULWEE PRINCESS (1) has been in the money at her last two runs, most recently when third beaten 1.75 lengths (17.77). The form out of her last race has been franked. Rates highly and will give a great sight. POPPY'S FOX (2) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by 3.5 lengths at this track in a handy 17.70 beating Good Odds Cuba. Smart beginner who should take advantage of the low draw. Bold showing expected again. SHE'S A ANGEL (8) was prominent early off a low draw but weakened and dropped out when 7th over 300m at this track in Grade 5 company. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings five times from nine starts. Cannot be taken lightly. BOB FURY (7) is in the mix despite finishing out of the placings here last start.",
